[make 5] -> 5 [drop 5] | a call's argument
[make 5] -> 5 [drop 5] | a &imm parameter
[make 2] [make 3] -> 5 [drop 3] [drop 2] | two arguments, newest dropped first
[make 5] -> 15 [drop 5] [drop 10] | a method's argument; the receiver outlives it
[make 4] -> 4 [drop 4] | a result that borrows from it, read in the statement
[make 5] -> 5 [drop 5] | the borrow written out is the same
[make 2] -> 2 -> 7 [drop 2] | a local's initializer extends it to the block's end
[make 1] [make 2] -> 3 [drop 2] [drop 1] | extended temporaries end newest first
[make 2] -> 2 [drop 2] [make 2] -> 2 [drop 2] [make 2] -> 2 [drop 2] | each pass of a loop
-> 1 -> 4 | a candidate taking the literal as it is wins; nothing is made
[make 2] -> 5 [drop 2] | a call no candidate takes otherwise falls back
[make name] -> 1 [drop name] | a type that lends str is no different
-> 4 | a cstr
-> 5 | a String
